                <pb facs="0727" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg645"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 417.00/108.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-12-05"><hi rendition="#italic">December 5,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Nicaraguan Government yesterday appointed Arthur R. Thompson on the mixed
                    claims commission.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
